WEBVTT

00:11.011 --> 00:15.015
NOTES FROM THE LAST ROW

00:21.604 --> 00:22.439
Sis?

00:28.486 --> 00:29.612
Dad…

00:34.784 --> 00:36.327
killed someone.

00:45.712 --> 00:47.005
I said Dad…

00:52.177 --> 00:53.887
killed someone.

00:55.805 --> 00:58.808
But that's just your imagination.

00:59.517 --> 01:00.852
It's not my imagination.

01:00.935 --> 01:02.771
I'm putting the pieces together.

01:04.647 --> 01:07.817
Then did you really see
the book all torn up?

01:07.901 --> 01:11.279
Yes. I happened to see it
when I went into Se-yun's room.

01:11.905 --> 01:13.740
His trash can was full of torn pages.

01:20.121 --> 01:21.039
No.

01:22.707 --> 01:24.084
Start over from the beginning.

01:27.253 --> 01:29.214
It's too early to conclude it's Se-yun.

01:31.633 --> 01:33.301
Nothing is certain yet.

01:36.930 --> 01:38.014
But

01:39.349 --> 01:40.809
Se-yun's been acting

01:42.227 --> 01:43.228
a bit strange lately.

01:48.358 --> 01:50.318
Strange? In what way?

01:53.571 --> 01:56.866
He rarely comes out of his room
after he gets back from school.

02:03.414 --> 02:04.541
Dinner's ready.

02:05.834 --> 02:06.751
I kept calling you.

02:12.924 --> 02:14.342
We should code after dinner.

02:14.425 --> 02:17.345
Fuck that! Just leave me alone, will you?

02:20.431 --> 02:24.602
I don't give a crap about coding anymore,
so don't come in here again.

02:41.870 --> 02:43.580
I've never seen him like that before.

02:49.878 --> 02:50.712
Hey.

02:50.795 --> 02:52.255
Why are you alone?

02:53.256 --> 02:54.132
What about Yun?

02:55.091 --> 02:56.426
He says he's not hungry.

02:57.177 --> 02:58.178
Again?

03:00.555 --> 03:02.056
He said the same yesterday.

03:03.558 --> 03:06.561
And he barely ate breakfast this morning
before he left for school.

03:07.228 --> 03:10.773
What's gotten into him lately?
Is something up with him?

03:14.194 --> 03:15.111
I'm not sure…

03:15.653 --> 03:17.822
I think he's been feeling down

03:19.157 --> 03:20.491
since that day.

03:21.284 --> 03:23.244
Can't blame him. I have too.

03:23.953 --> 03:24.787
Little brat.

03:24.871 --> 03:28.791
That's no excuse to lock himself
in his room and refuse to eat.

03:29.542 --> 03:30.752
I'll go get him.

03:31.502 --> 03:33.379
Honey, leave him be.

03:33.880 --> 03:35.215
I'll talk to him later…

03:37.508 --> 03:38.760
Hey, Kim Se-yun!

03:39.844 --> 03:41.054
But the strangest thing…

03:41.137 --> 03:41.971
Kim Se-yun!

03:42.055 --> 03:43.640
…is his relationship with Mr. Kim.

03:49.062 --> 03:51.439
You really don't have an appetite, do you?

03:56.402 --> 04:01.157
If we had Min-hui's braised short ribs,
he'd eat a whole bowl of rice in no time.

04:04.077 --> 04:07.038
Why would you bring up a dead person?

04:09.040 --> 04:09.874
Oh yeah.

04:10.625 --> 04:11.876
You're right.

04:12.418 --> 04:14.128
Her name keeps slipping out.

04:15.964 --> 04:18.007
I'm sorry. Sorry.

04:18.091 --> 04:19.968
Eat. Eat up, everyone.

04:27.684 --> 04:30.687
Maybe it's because of the funeral.

04:32.355 --> 04:35.275
I think I keep bringing her up
because it's weighing on my mind.

04:37.819 --> 04:41.322
I mean, I just feel so sorry for Min-hui.

04:43.283 --> 04:45.159
She hasn't even had a funeral yet.

04:46.327 --> 04:48.663
I heard they did find her family.

04:49.289 --> 04:51.457
She has a father who remarried,

04:51.958 --> 04:53.668
but he couldn't care less.

04:54.168 --> 04:58.089
I heard her sister was the only
close blood relative she had,

04:58.172 --> 04:59.424
but even she

05:00.508 --> 05:03.845
died of an illness last year.

05:06.556 --> 05:07.515
So then

05:08.349 --> 05:10.101
what about her funeral?

05:11.019 --> 05:12.562
That's what I'm saying.

05:14.188 --> 05:18.067
If nothing comes up, I should discuss it
with the president of our church group.

05:18.651 --> 05:21.696
If that happens,
we'd have to raise some funds.

05:21.779 --> 05:23.906
No, don't ask the church volunteer group.

05:25.366 --> 05:26.200
No?

05:26.868 --> 05:27.702
Why not?

05:28.202 --> 05:29.412
Fundraising or whatever…

05:31.831 --> 05:35.501
would take too long. The funeral
should be held as soon as possible.

05:36.169 --> 05:38.880
People might talk.

05:40.423 --> 05:42.592
That would be disrespectful
to the deceased.

05:43.760 --> 05:46.429
If money's the issue,
we can take care of it.

05:47.430 --> 05:48.431
I'll pay for it.

05:49.015 --> 05:50.683
-You will?
-Yeah.

05:51.726 --> 05:52.643
Of course.

05:52.727 --> 05:55.688
She did work in our home for a while.

05:55.772 --> 05:58.274
We should take care of her to the end.

05:58.775 --> 06:00.401
It's the least we could do.

06:03.029 --> 06:04.072
Oh, honey.

06:04.697 --> 06:05.907
You really are so--

06:05.990 --> 06:07.116
Thanks for the meal.

06:10.161 --> 06:11.287
Thanks for the meal.

06:17.794 --> 06:19.170
Repulsive bastard!

06:19.670 --> 06:20.880
That son of a bitch.

06:21.506 --> 06:22.340
Sorry?

06:28.805 --> 06:29.972
Se-yun.

06:31.224 --> 06:32.683
He seems completely fine

06:33.309 --> 06:35.520
whenever I see him at school.

06:35.603 --> 06:39.190
And his assignments are normal.
He always writes about trivial stuff.

06:39.273 --> 06:40.650
Yes, that's right.

06:40.733 --> 06:44.112
He's like that at home
but acts like nothing's wrong at school.

06:44.612 --> 06:46.239
Even plays ball with his friends.

06:49.367 --> 06:50.368
Kang.

06:51.202 --> 06:52.537
Time to revisit the hotel.

06:53.579 --> 06:55.164
-The hotel?
-Yeah.

06:55.957 --> 06:58.209
Always look before you leap, as they say.

06:59.043 --> 07:01.504
It's crucial to get
the facts straight first.

07:06.050 --> 07:08.094
It's time for our class. We should go.

07:08.177 --> 07:09.011
-Already?
-Hurry!

07:09.095 --> 07:10.596
-See you.
-Yeah.

07:35.872 --> 07:37.290
Was it really you?

07:39.542 --> 07:41.127
Se-yun.

07:43.880 --> 07:45.756
I hope it really was you.

07:54.557 --> 07:56.476
Kim Su-hun, you bastard.

07:57.351 --> 07:58.728
What the hell

08:00.188 --> 08:02.315
did your son find out about you?

08:18.789 --> 08:20.291
I was right, Mr. Heo.

08:20.791 --> 08:21.792
About Se-yun.

08:29.342 --> 08:30.343
I see.

08:31.886 --> 08:34.180
So it was him after all.

08:36.140 --> 08:38.809
I only managed to get this
by begging Jae-sik for it.

08:41.562 --> 08:42.480
We got it!

08:43.314 --> 08:44.857
We got it.

08:46.526 --> 08:47.735
So now,

08:48.945 --> 08:51.906
we just need to find out
what Kim Se-yun knows.

08:57.161 --> 08:58.287
Hey.

08:59.247 --> 09:00.456
Why the long face?

09:01.457 --> 09:02.291
Sorry?

09:03.543 --> 09:05.169
What do you…

09:06.796 --> 09:08.881
Why do you look like you just ate shit?

09:12.426 --> 09:13.719
Well, it's just…

09:14.804 --> 09:16.055
Just what?

09:17.431 --> 09:18.849
You got something else to say?

09:19.850 --> 09:20.893
If so, go ahead.

09:25.565 --> 09:28.776
My mind is all over the place
thinking about Se-yun.

09:33.739 --> 09:35.116
Until recently,

09:36.117 --> 09:39.579
it felt pretty satisfying to find out
that Mr. Kim was a bad person.

09:40.663 --> 09:41.747
Do you know why?

09:44.166 --> 09:46.043
Se-yun was kind of annoying.

09:47.169 --> 09:50.256
He seemed to have the perfect life
and everything he could ever want.

09:53.926 --> 09:55.553
But seeing him these days…

09:59.724 --> 10:01.350
I guess it really does hurt

10:02.560 --> 10:04.103
to watch a friend suffer.

10:18.284 --> 10:19.744
Yeah, exactly.

10:20.620 --> 10:22.330
That's why we're helping Se-yun.

10:24.582 --> 10:25.416
Sorry?

10:26.584 --> 10:27.752
Don't you get it?

10:28.544 --> 10:32.048
If we find out what Kim Se-yun knows,

10:33.049 --> 10:37.345
we might be able to help him.
Ever heard of thinking outside the box?

10:41.599 --> 10:44.101
Besides,
that's the thing about friendship.

10:44.185 --> 10:47.271
Covering up the truth
isn't always the best solution.

10:47.772 --> 10:50.900
Sometimes, uncovering the truth

10:51.400 --> 10:55.196
and making your friend face it
can be the best thing for them.

10:59.200 --> 11:00.159
Are we good now?

11:01.035 --> 11:02.411
From now on,

11:03.204 --> 11:04.830
whenever you're conflicted,

11:06.499 --> 11:09.377
remind yourself
that we're helping your friend.

11:10.753 --> 11:11.671
Okay.

11:14.548 --> 11:15.758
By the way, Mr. Heo,

11:16.842 --> 11:18.010
I have some news.

11:19.303 --> 11:20.221
News?

11:20.304 --> 11:24.517
Se-yun's sister, Jeong-hu,
is coming home on Sunday.

11:25.434 --> 11:26.852
It's Mr. Kim's birthday.

11:28.896 --> 11:30.356
Kim Su-hun's birthday?

11:30.940 --> 11:35.403
Se-yun is really close to his sister.
They seem to stay in touch a lot too.

11:37.988 --> 11:38.989
Is that right?

11:41.534 --> 11:43.911
Then listen to every single word

11:44.412 --> 11:45.496
those two exchange

11:45.996 --> 11:47.540
when they're alone.

11:48.207 --> 11:50.251
Something will come up
in their conversations.

11:51.127 --> 11:52.253
That is this week's

11:53.170 --> 11:54.672
investigative assignment.

12:06.892 --> 12:07.727
Here.

12:12.022 --> 12:13.232
Even

12:13.858 --> 12:15.401
your autograph is cool.

12:16.026 --> 12:16.861
Like your novel.

12:18.529 --> 12:19.697
The honor is mine.

12:20.197 --> 12:23.659
Se-yun, on the other hand,
has zero interest in what I write.

12:26.162 --> 12:26.996
Here.

12:28.789 --> 12:30.040
Where's Dad?

12:30.583 --> 12:32.168
The man of the hour?

12:32.251 --> 12:33.419
Dad?

12:34.879 --> 12:38.257
Your dad went to Min-hui's funeral.

12:38.758 --> 12:42.928
He'll be back this evening
after running some errands.

12:43.429 --> 12:44.764
Her funeral?

12:45.473 --> 12:46.307
Of all days…

12:48.058 --> 12:49.977
So it's happening after all.

12:50.060 --> 12:51.604
It's a relief

12:52.104 --> 12:54.440
that they can finally hold the funeral.

12:55.316 --> 12:58.736
I wanted to go with him,
but your dad told me to stay home--

12:58.819 --> 13:00.196
Why would you go?

13:02.406 --> 13:05.326
What do you mean, why?
I'd have reason to attend, wouldn't I?

13:07.161 --> 13:08.037
I just mean,

13:09.330 --> 13:13.000
I haven't visited in a while.
If both of you weren't here, it'd be…

13:15.252 --> 13:16.170
There he is.

13:17.087 --> 13:18.339
Did you just wake up?

13:19.381 --> 13:20.424
You're here.

13:21.717 --> 13:24.970
All done sleeping now, sleepyhead?

13:25.971 --> 13:28.182
Still, you managed to get him downstairs.

13:28.682 --> 13:30.309
What? What do you mean?

13:31.602 --> 13:34.021
This one's been holed up
in his room lately,

13:34.104 --> 13:35.689
gaming all day and night.

13:35.773 --> 13:37.316
You should give him a talking-to.

13:38.818 --> 13:43.280
Yun's always listened to his sister,
ever since he was a kid.

13:43.989 --> 13:45.616
He was always her shadow.

13:48.452 --> 13:50.246
Then I should give him a talking-to.

13:50.329 --> 13:53.833
Hey, you little shit.
Come with me. You're dead meat.

13:53.916 --> 13:55.376
I won't go easy on you.

13:55.459 --> 13:58.003
-I told you to be good, didn't I?
-Excuse me?

13:59.004 --> 14:01.549
-Hey, you punk.
-I'm not a little kid anymore.

14:01.632 --> 14:02.466
Hey.

14:02.550 --> 14:05.302
All right, then.
Take it easy until your dad gets home.

14:05.386 --> 14:07.304
-Don't move.
-I have a lot of work to do.

14:07.388 --> 14:08.889
Let go. Three, two…

14:33.247 --> 14:34.665
How shameless.

14:35.332 --> 14:38.252
He went to that woman's funeral
on a family day?

14:41.505 --> 14:45.551
He must feel a little guilty for cheating,
seeing how he wouldn't let Mom go.

14:45.634 --> 14:48.512
As I expected, Jeong-hu knows too.

14:48.596 --> 14:50.806
But how can Mom be so blind
to all of this?

14:51.307 --> 14:53.142
And she actually wanted to go?

14:53.225 --> 14:55.185
Seriously, it drives me crazy.

14:56.520 --> 14:57.521
No.

14:58.981 --> 15:00.274
It's good Mom doesn't know.

15:03.027 --> 15:04.945
If I'm honest,

15:05.446 --> 15:07.489
I think Mom should know too.

15:07.573 --> 15:10.492
How long has Dad been womanizing
in the name of art?

15:14.288 --> 15:16.123
Should we just drop the bomb today?

15:16.206 --> 15:19.293
-To hell with his birthday.
-No, you can't!

15:24.506 --> 15:27.927
Someone as sensitive as Mom
wouldn't be able to handle it.

15:29.845 --> 15:31.305
Don't you remember?

15:31.805 --> 15:35.309
Years ago, when Mom was depressed,
and she took some pills

15:35.893 --> 15:37.561
to kill herself.

15:39.939 --> 15:42.232
Mom must think I don't know,
but I remember it all.

15:42.316 --> 15:43.859
But if she finds out about this…

15:46.612 --> 15:48.656
No. I'm going to protect Mom.

15:48.739 --> 15:51.116
Okay, I get it.

15:52.242 --> 15:54.828
That's why I'm keeping my mouth shut.

15:57.247 --> 16:00.542
But, fucking hell,
this one is a real shocker.

16:00.626 --> 16:02.419
She used to work in our home!

16:02.503 --> 16:04.129
He's a real piece of shit.

16:05.297 --> 16:07.424
And to top it all off, that accident…

16:10.636 --> 16:11.637
But

16:13.138 --> 16:14.181
Min-hui…

16:16.809 --> 16:18.394
didn't die from an accident.

16:20.396 --> 16:21.230
What?

16:22.189 --> 16:24.984
I couldn't bring myself
to tell you over the phone.

16:25.651 --> 16:27.695
Then tell me now.
What do you mean by that?

16:30.572 --> 16:31.865
Min-hui…

16:34.994 --> 16:36.578
Dad killed her.

16:38.706 --> 16:39.832
What did you say?

16:41.542 --> 16:42.793
Well, you see…

16:43.419 --> 16:44.461
Jeong-hu.

16:44.962 --> 16:45.796
Se-yun.

16:47.631 --> 16:48.465
Kim Jeong-hu.

16:49.800 --> 16:50.718
Kim Se-yun.

16:53.387 --> 16:55.973
Kang, where are the kids?

16:56.056 --> 16:57.599
Why aren't they answering?

16:58.517 --> 16:59.560
I don't know.

17:00.269 --> 17:01.353
I'm not really sure…

17:02.104 --> 17:05.190
Then could you come and take a look, Kang?

17:06.275 --> 17:07.109
Sorry?

17:24.043 --> 17:26.462
What do you think? Does it look okay?

17:28.255 --> 17:31.842
For some reason,
I wanted to make it myself this year.

17:32.342 --> 17:33.427
What do you think?

17:34.428 --> 17:36.138
Should I add more decorations?

17:36.221 --> 17:39.600
No, it's good. Much prettier
than the ones sold in stores.

17:40.225 --> 17:41.143
Really?

17:42.019 --> 17:42.978
You think so?

17:43.479 --> 17:44.605
Yes, really.

17:46.273 --> 17:47.483
I'll be going, then.

17:47.983 --> 17:48.984
What do you think

17:49.651 --> 17:52.154
I should write on top?

17:52.780 --> 17:55.157
Perhaps a unique birthday message?

18:00.079 --> 18:01.246
No way.

18:01.747 --> 18:03.749
No, you must have seen wrong.

18:05.250 --> 18:07.711
Sure, Dad's a bastard,
but he wouldn't do that.

18:07.795 --> 18:09.421
No, I saw everything--

18:09.505 --> 18:11.048
I said it can't be true!

18:13.550 --> 18:14.551
Unfortunately,

18:15.052 --> 18:18.806
the important part of the conversation
was already over by the time I arrived.

18:22.267 --> 18:23.894
What happened is

18:25.312 --> 18:27.481
you lost your mind from gaming too hard.

18:27.564 --> 18:28.816
A crazy hallucination.

18:28.899 --> 18:30.776
-But I did learn…
-Don't say that!

18:30.859 --> 18:32.194
…one crucial fact.

18:32.277 --> 18:33.403
I told you.

18:33.904 --> 18:37.241
I secretly tailed them
to the hospital after the accident.

19:00.597 --> 19:01.515
All right.

19:02.266 --> 19:04.518
Let's say, for argument's sake,
that it's true.

19:05.227 --> 19:06.854
In that case,

19:07.521 --> 19:10.232
this wouldn't just be a scandalous affair.

19:10.315 --> 19:11.400
It would mean…

19:13.652 --> 19:15.988
the reputation that Dad's built up,

19:16.905 --> 19:18.824
and the world I've just stepped into…

19:18.907 --> 19:21.410
It would all go up in flames.

19:21.910 --> 19:22.744
You get that?

19:23.537 --> 19:25.497
-Jeong-hu.
-You…

19:26.123 --> 19:27.791
Have you told anyone about this?

19:28.375 --> 19:29.209
Lee Kang.

19:29.877 --> 19:31.044
Did you tell him?

19:31.128 --> 19:33.797
Why would I tell anyone else?
I only told you.

19:37.885 --> 19:40.971
Okay, that's fine. That's fine, then.

19:42.097 --> 19:43.182
Jeong-hu.

19:43.265 --> 19:44.474
Okay, yeah.

19:44.558 --> 19:47.102
Then you just need to keep
your mouth shut. That's all.

19:47.603 --> 19:50.606
Thankfully, it seems like
the police overlooked it, too,

19:50.689 --> 19:52.274
so everything's fine.

20:00.574 --> 20:01.992
Jeong-hu, you're really…

20:11.084 --> 20:12.753
You weak-ass piece of shit.

20:13.837 --> 20:15.422
If you don't do as I say,

20:16.465 --> 20:18.091
I will kill you.

20:19.092 --> 20:20.469
I'll make you pay.

20:32.981 --> 20:34.066
Se-yun

20:34.566 --> 20:36.777
shut himself up in his room again.

20:39.029 --> 20:42.074
Yun, what are you doing? Come out here.

20:43.408 --> 20:44.868
Jeong-hu's leaving.

20:48.038 --> 20:51.959
He didn't even come out
to see Jeong-hu off.

20:56.546 --> 20:58.048
Are you okay, Mr. Heo?

21:04.221 --> 21:05.639
Well,

21:05.722 --> 21:08.100
I just heard so many shocking things.

21:10.227 --> 21:12.229
I don't even know where to start.

21:13.605 --> 21:14.690
I know, right?

21:15.232 --> 21:17.442
I was shocked at every turn too.

21:18.860 --> 21:21.196
I had no idea they had so many secrets.

21:22.656 --> 21:24.741
I see that house completely differently

21:25.242 --> 21:26.660
from my first visit now.

21:27.244 --> 21:28.245
In any case…

21:30.539 --> 21:32.040
we're back to square one.

21:33.750 --> 21:35.961
You didn't hear anything definitive.

21:36.461 --> 21:38.130
But one thing's for certain.

21:38.213 --> 21:42.050
Se-yun knows something.
And he was at the hotel that day--

21:42.134 --> 21:44.052
That's right. That's it.

21:45.178 --> 21:47.931
He was definitely
at the scene of the accident.

21:48.432 --> 21:50.851
And he tailed them to the hospital
and saw something.

21:51.601 --> 21:52.519
Yes.

21:53.478 --> 21:55.439
That's the most surprising part.

21:58.191 --> 22:00.027
How did Se-yun know to go to the hotel,

22:01.236 --> 22:03.196
and what did he see at the hospital?

22:03.697 --> 22:04.781
But

22:05.615 --> 22:07.951
the kicker is that his own sister

22:08.535 --> 22:10.537
muzzled him.

22:12.372 --> 22:16.877
So the key now is getting Se-yun to talk.

22:17.377 --> 22:20.297
Speaking of which,
we need to take drastic measures.

22:21.590 --> 22:22.466
Drastic measures?

22:23.258 --> 22:26.094
I think we'll have to get
Mrs. Ahn involved.

22:28.388 --> 22:29.473
-Eun-joo?
-Yes.

22:31.892 --> 22:33.143
"Eun-joo"?

22:34.394 --> 22:36.188
Do you know her personally too?

22:36.271 --> 22:37.689
That's not important.

22:38.940 --> 22:40.776
Get her involved? How?

22:40.859 --> 22:46.073
Well, Mrs. Ahn is the only one left,
since Jeong-hu is a lost cause.

22:46.573 --> 22:48.408
And there's no way he'll open up to me.

22:48.492 --> 22:51.995
So we give Mrs. Ahn a glimpse of the truth

22:52.079 --> 22:55.540
to make her question Se-yun herself.

22:56.041 --> 22:58.085
Right now, she knows nothing.

23:01.129 --> 23:03.173
Isn't that a good plan to find out more?

23:03.256 --> 23:04.383
No.

23:06.301 --> 23:07.135
Why not?

23:07.219 --> 23:09.096
Don't you remember what Se-yun said?

23:10.389 --> 23:11.932
He said his mom took pills

23:12.432 --> 23:14.309
and almost killed herself!

23:21.066 --> 23:24.111
You gotta pity the poor kid,
being so worried about his mom, right?

23:24.194 --> 23:25.487
Still,

23:26.947 --> 23:30.075
it's the only shot we've got
at finding out the truth.

23:35.372 --> 23:37.332
Now you're the one hesitating.

23:38.417 --> 23:39.501
Why is that?

23:40.377 --> 23:41.920
Is it because of Mrs. Ahn?

23:42.921 --> 23:44.297
Are you worried about her?

23:45.090 --> 23:47.426
-What's your relationship with her?
-We're nothing!

23:47.926 --> 23:50.637
We're just acquaintances
from my junior year in college!

23:51.805 --> 23:53.557
Satisfied? You punk.

24:01.356 --> 24:02.274
Anyway…

24:08.363 --> 24:11.741
we'll discuss this again at length later.

24:14.494 --> 24:15.745
Let's call it a day.

24:16.329 --> 24:18.540
I'm tired.
Make sure to write everything up

24:19.124 --> 24:21.334
and submit your assignment
as soon as possible.

24:38.768 --> 24:40.395
-Hey, what's up?
-Hello, Professor.

24:40.479 --> 24:43.565
Are you aware that there's
an academic forum at 2:00 p.m. today?

24:43.648 --> 24:45.484
-The president asked.
-Right.

24:45.567 --> 24:47.444
Since you haven't submitted your paper.

24:50.447 --> 24:51.990
Okay, I'll send it over now.

24:54.075 --> 24:56.077
I said I got it. 2:00 p.m.

25:04.085 --> 25:09.090
I was just passing by
and thought we could have lunch together.

25:10.342 --> 25:11.801
Okay, honey.

25:13.553 --> 25:16.348
Enjoy class. Okay.

25:16.932 --> 25:19.434
I'll see you at home. Bye.

26:49.608 --> 26:50.609
It's you.

26:51.901 --> 26:53.111
It's really you.

27:00.160 --> 27:01.411
Ahn Eun-joo.

27:02.746 --> 27:03.788
Eun-joo.

27:12.589 --> 27:14.799
TEACHING ASSISTANT KIM MI-SEO

29:24.179 --> 29:26.931
Honey, why did you come so early?

29:27.015 --> 29:28.683
Because I missed you, of course.

29:28.767 --> 29:29.976
You tease.

29:36.733 --> 29:38.276
Is it too cryptic?

29:38.359 --> 29:39.402
No, it's nice.

29:39.903 --> 29:41.196
There it is.

29:43.448 --> 29:44.783
-Right.
-What do you think?

29:45.867 --> 29:46.951
Yeah, it's nice.

29:47.452 --> 29:49.788
Seeing those kids eat is making me hungry.

29:51.790 --> 29:53.500
Is it too dark?

29:54.125 --> 29:55.001
No.

29:56.085 --> 29:57.212
What do you want to eat?

29:58.004 --> 29:59.547
-Are you hungry?
-Yeah.

29:59.631 --> 30:00.799
What should we eat?

30:03.051 --> 30:05.887
Should we have pasta? Or how about pizza?

30:06.387 --> 30:08.389
-Let's just order both.
-Okay.

30:08.890 --> 30:10.099
There's one up there too.

31:16.875 --> 31:17.709
Eun-joo.

31:18.334 --> 31:19.377
Eun-joo.

31:24.465 --> 31:27.260
What do I do now? Now what do I do?

31:27.343 --> 31:28.761
What should I do?

31:35.894 --> 31:37.145
What do I do now?

31:45.403 --> 31:46.446
What do I do?

31:54.704 --> 31:56.497
What are you muttering to yourself?

31:57.665 --> 31:59.417
You haven't even changed your clothes.

32:04.631 --> 32:06.007
How about a glass of wine?

32:14.974 --> 32:18.186
The couple I met for their final session
gave it to me today.

32:18.269 --> 32:20.104
They said they're doing much better.

32:23.107 --> 32:27.987
When they first came to see me,
they were in a really bad place.

32:30.323 --> 32:31.199
But…

32:33.076 --> 32:35.912
after just a few sessions,
things improved noticeably.

32:37.997 --> 32:41.376
It made me realize
how important it is to talk.

32:46.881 --> 32:49.133
Why were you lying down like that earlier?

32:50.301 --> 32:51.386
Did something happen?

32:52.303 --> 32:53.763
You don't look so good.

32:55.765 --> 32:57.183
I'm just a little tired.

33:02.897 --> 33:06.859
Have you stopped those literature lessons?
I liked how energetic they made you.

33:08.194 --> 33:11.280
I already told you.
I'm not doing them anymore.

33:18.913 --> 33:21.457
So you won't sleep in my room
anymore either?

33:24.377 --> 33:25.420
What is it…

33:27.296 --> 33:28.464
that you want to say?

33:37.056 --> 33:38.850
I want to apologize to you.

33:39.350 --> 33:41.019
I went too far that day.

33:45.732 --> 33:47.608
You know, the day we went to the movies.

33:48.860 --> 33:50.570
In the heat of the moment, I asked

33:51.654 --> 33:54.032
if you had an inferiority complex
toward Kim Su-hun.

33:55.950 --> 33:58.161
What I said kept bothering me.

33:59.495 --> 34:00.872
I know

34:02.290 --> 34:04.876
writers are sensitive
about that kind of thing.

34:07.086 --> 34:09.672
I know better than anybody…

34:11.299 --> 34:13.551
how much you struggled
when you couldn't write.

34:13.634 --> 34:15.011
That's enough.

34:17.180 --> 34:18.723
Why bring that up again?

34:20.433 --> 34:22.560
I'm just apologizing

34:22.643 --> 34:25.063
for crossing a line that day.

34:42.080 --> 34:43.706
What? Who is it?

34:47.460 --> 34:48.336
Honey.

34:49.587 --> 34:50.546
Honey?

35:05.103 --> 35:07.730
Hey, what's this? What picture is this?

35:08.439 --> 35:10.525
A letter. I took a picture of a letter.

35:10.608 --> 35:13.152
A strange letter arrived
at the house this afternoon.

35:13.694 --> 35:14.529
A letter?

35:26.040 --> 35:27.208
What's this?

35:28.918 --> 35:30.503
There's no sender.

35:31.129 --> 35:32.421
Just your name.

35:32.505 --> 35:33.506
What?

35:34.966 --> 35:36.592
KIM SU-HUN

35:38.761 --> 35:39.762
Welcome home.

35:39.846 --> 35:40.805
Hey.

35:41.764 --> 35:42.974
Is Yun home too?

35:43.057 --> 35:45.560
Yes, he's been gaming
since he got home earlier.

35:49.522 --> 35:51.774
Then could you help put these away?

35:52.275 --> 35:53.985
I'm going to go and check in on Yun.

35:54.068 --> 35:55.778
Sure, go ahead. I'll put these away.

35:59.782 --> 36:00.616
Yun!

36:01.659 --> 36:03.161
Mom's home!

36:04.745 --> 36:07.582
We brought your favorite pizza
from Mangwon-dong!

36:11.085 --> 36:12.044
What is it?

36:13.004 --> 36:13.921
Nothing.

36:14.547 --> 36:16.757
Just fan mail. Nothing important.

36:19.760 --> 36:20.928
Fan mail?

36:22.180 --> 36:24.390
A handwritten letter, not an email?

36:25.516 --> 36:27.351
It happens from time to time.

36:27.894 --> 36:31.314
Older fans like
this sort of sentimentality.

36:37.612 --> 36:38.905
Damn it.

36:47.121 --> 36:48.664
Mr. Kim was acting strange.

36:49.332 --> 36:50.958
Even his hands were shaking.

40:31.262 --> 40:32.972
I HAVE THE HOSPITAL CCTV FOOTAGE

40:33.055 --> 40:35.391
10 PM TONIGHT
CENTRAL FOUNTAIN IN SEONGCHANG PARK

40:43.399 --> 40:44.733
Hospital CCTV footage?

40:46.694 --> 40:48.195
Does it really exist?

40:48.279 --> 40:50.990
I don't know yet,
but that's what the letter said.

40:51.073 --> 40:52.324
Right.

40:53.367 --> 40:56.370
If the footage really exists,
it would be the nail in the coffin.

40:57.788 --> 41:01.083
But who sent this letter?
Was it Kim Se-yun?

41:01.584 --> 41:04.086
-He's our best bet at the moment.
-Right.

41:04.920 --> 41:08.382
Kim Se-yun did mention
the hospital to his sister.

41:09.425 --> 41:10.801
Yeah, there's that,

41:11.510 --> 41:13.179
but something else happened.

41:14.430 --> 41:15.306
Something else?

41:15.389 --> 41:17.850
Yes, during dinner tonight.

41:26.150 --> 41:28.819
This place's pizza really is
the best way to lure Yun out.

41:28.903 --> 41:30.696
You were right, honey.

41:32.573 --> 41:33.407
What is it?

41:34.074 --> 41:35.743
What's on your mind, honey?

41:36.619 --> 41:37.453
Nothing.

41:38.120 --> 41:40.247
You're right.
This place has the best pizza.

41:45.002 --> 41:49.340
How about we go see a late-night movie
after this? It's been a while.

41:50.007 --> 41:51.217
A late-night movie?

41:51.300 --> 41:53.552
Or we could just go for a drive.

41:53.636 --> 41:55.304
Doesn't that sound wonderful?

41:55.387 --> 41:58.307
It'd be a waste to stay home
on a night like this.

41:58.933 --> 42:01.852
No, I can't. I have plans,
so I have to go out in a bit.

42:01.936 --> 42:04.772
Plans? What plans? All of a sudden?

42:04.855 --> 42:06.899
Yeah, suddenly.
Mr. Choi asked to meet, so…

42:07.942 --> 42:10.069
You three should go to a movie
or for a drive.

42:10.861 --> 42:14.031
Come on. It wouldn't be fun without you.

42:14.698 --> 42:15.991
I'll pass for today too.

42:16.492 --> 42:19.328
I'm meeting friends
from my department at 10:00 p.m.

42:20.037 --> 42:22.122
You too? All of a sudden?

42:22.206 --> 42:24.124
It's not exactly sudden.

42:25.584 --> 42:27.253
I've been waiting for it for ages.

42:36.720 --> 42:38.472
Se-yun's eyes looked different.

42:39.765 --> 42:41.225
As though he'd made up his mind.

42:42.643 --> 42:46.230
I'm heading to the place
mentioned in the letter now.

42:48.524 --> 42:49.525
Hey!

42:50.025 --> 42:53.654
You're heading there now?
You're moving without my orders?

42:54.154 --> 42:55.573
You said

42:56.073 --> 42:59.368
that when I'm conflicted, I should
remind myself what all this is for.

43:00.744 --> 43:01.662
What?

43:01.745 --> 43:03.956
I'm going there to help my friend.

43:07.585 --> 43:08.752
I see.

43:10.129 --> 43:12.298
Se-yun's finally worked up the courage.

43:12.798 --> 43:15.593
If I witness that scene,
I'll be able to find something out.

43:21.557 --> 43:23.726
Okay, I understand. Go ahead.

43:24.268 --> 43:28.522
And call me as soon as it's over, okay?

43:29.857 --> 43:31.025
And one more thing.

43:31.984 --> 43:35.154
You must not get caught.
You understand, don't you?

43:35.904 --> 43:36.864
Yes, I do.

43:38.073 --> 43:39.241
I'll call you.

44:10.522 --> 44:11.690
Honey.

44:15.319 --> 44:17.112
Why are you lying again?

44:17.655 --> 44:19.448
You said you stopped the lessons.

44:24.078 --> 44:26.330
And what was all that
weird stuff you said?

44:27.456 --> 44:29.416
What did you mean
about not getting caught?

44:30.542 --> 44:32.419
Eavesdropping again? How uncivilized.

44:34.588 --> 44:35.464
Uncivilized?

44:38.050 --> 44:39.593
If you're drunk, just go to bed.

44:40.636 --> 44:43.222
-Hey, Heo Mun-oh.
-Stop it!

44:43.305 --> 44:45.557
I said stop it, okay?

44:46.350 --> 44:48.310
I told you to keep your nose out.

44:48.852 --> 44:49.895
Do you have any idea

44:50.854 --> 44:52.439
how serious the situation is?

44:52.523 --> 44:55.150
Serious? You mean,
another thing I don't know about!

45:00.948 --> 45:02.866
Yeah, it's always been like this.

45:05.244 --> 45:06.954
You always had

45:08.580 --> 45:10.916
something serious going on
that I didn't know about.

45:10.999 --> 45:12.459
From the very start.

45:13.669 --> 45:17.756
Because you were writing
or because you had writer's block.

45:21.885 --> 45:24.471
I was always here,
and yet you never cared about me.

45:25.806 --> 45:26.849
Do you even know

45:27.850 --> 45:31.061
how shitty I feel
whenever I do couples counseling?

45:31.562 --> 45:34.481
"Talk to each other constantly.
Communication is key."

45:36.233 --> 45:37.943
That's what I tell them, yet I…

45:40.696 --> 45:41.613
We…

45:44.491 --> 45:46.994
You're the one who doesn't know a thing.

45:48.620 --> 45:51.248
How much I let slide.

45:51.331 --> 45:56.003
How long I've put up with you,

45:57.463 --> 45:58.881
waited for you,

46:00.382 --> 46:01.967
and endured you.

46:04.303 --> 46:05.554
Do you have any idea?

46:09.641 --> 46:11.310
Quit your whining.

48:03.630 --> 48:04.715
A comb? Nice.

48:04.798 --> 48:06.425
So you're not empty-handed.

48:06.508 --> 48:08.427
-A comb.
-No one has their phone…

48:20.022 --> 48:21.148
LEE KANG

48:30.198 --> 48:31.825
The person you are calling…

49:33.345 --> 49:34.262
What is it?

49:37.766 --> 49:39.226
Don't tell me that punk…

49:40.560 --> 49:41.770
At this hour?

49:54.366 --> 49:56.785
Mr. Heo, I know everything. Everything!

49:57.452 --> 49:59.496
-I know all of Mr. Kim's secrets--
-Quiet!

49:59.997 --> 50:00.831
Quickly, get in.

50:01.873 --> 50:03.375
I know everything. Really.

50:03.458 --> 50:05.085
Just get inside.

50:06.086 --> 50:07.045
Hurry.

50:16.388 --> 50:18.265
Have you totally lost it?

50:18.765 --> 50:20.058
How come you…

50:20.559 --> 50:22.185
Why did you come here at this time?

50:22.269 --> 50:25.897
Do you know what's even more shocking?
Know what's even more riveting?

50:25.981 --> 50:27.524
You've seriously lost it.

50:27.607 --> 50:28.775
Mr. Heo, that young man

50:29.401 --> 50:30.986
wasn't Se-yun.

50:31.611 --> 50:33.363
It wasn't Se-yun!

50:44.541 --> 50:46.626
Se-yun! It's me, Lee Kang!

50:47.127 --> 50:48.545
Hey, stop!

51:10.150 --> 51:12.486
What? That young man…

51:14.279 --> 51:15.739
wasn't Kim Se-yun?

51:17.074 --> 51:18.408
No, it was Mrs. Ahn.

51:20.160 --> 51:21.578
Se-yun's mom.

51:22.329 --> 51:23.163
Ahn Eun-joo.

51:29.211 --> 51:30.295
Ahn Eun-joo?

51:53.944 --> 51:55.070
It was Eun-joo?

51:59.157 --> 52:00.659
It was dear Eun-joo?

52:04.121 --> 52:05.664
NOTES FROM THE LAST ROW

52:05.747 --> 52:07.082
It was Eun-joo?

54:33.228 --> 54:38.233
Subtitle translation by: Jimin Choi
